      "handle": "allen_ai",
      "name": "Ai2",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1819065604370051072/UrIOp6zI_normal.png",
      "verified": false,
      "text": "To gather feedback, we're releasing de-identified annotated tutoring transcripts plus code &amp; scored replays.\n💻 Code: github.com/allenai/tutorm…\n🤗 Data: huggingface.co/datasets/allen…\n🌐 Learn more: allenai.org/blog/tutormome…",
