      "handle": "allen_ai",
      "name": "Ai2",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1819065604370051072/UrIOp6zI_normal.png",
      "verified": false,
      "text": "In our replays, models told only to \"tutor well\" tend to over-help, providing lots of support but rarely pushing toward deeper thinking.\nThat suggests a model's default helpful-assistant behavior isn't enough on its own to tutor well.",
      "createdAt": "Fri Aug 07 16:23:57 +0000 2026",
