      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/939313677647282181/vZjFWtAn_normal.jpg",
      "verified": true,
      "text": "Picking the right agent harness is now a crucial skill for any AI engineer.\nImagine using the same model, same task, and same prompt. Now move it between two agent harnesses and the cost per success can swing by 5 to 30x.\nThis benchmark measured this across six large reasoning",
