      "verified": true,
      "text": "GPT-Live can listen while it speaks.\nTo make that feel natural at ChatGPT scale, we rebuilt the voice stack from client to model.\nThis new architecture keeps audio flowing continuously, so deeper reasoning and tool use don't interrupt the conversation.",
